msgid ""
"Cannot access %1\n"
"Make sure that the device exists and that you have write permission to it."
msgstr ""
"Dji n' a seu avni a %1\n"
"Estoz vs seur(e) ki cist éndjin egzistêye et ki vos poloz bén scrire "
"dissu."

